Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "source .venv/bin/activate && clear"
Enter
Type `python query.py --provider deepseek "What is the coverage target for Tier 1 production resources?"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 20s
